summary:
Peter Parker survived the snap but did he really? Now he's stuck in an entirely different universe with the souls of the dusted Avengers following him around and giving him advice...most of the time. Now he needs to figure out a way to keep himself and in turn them alive while simultaneously trying to figure out how he can get back and save his universe without entirely abandoning this one.
OR;
My own version of Peter in Gotham except I don't baby his character and he's actually more a vigilante then he is a 'hero'! This means his strength, healing factor, smarts and other skills aren't dwelled down like I often see in some Peter fics.

Peter comes down with the flu while at a party thrown by Stark Industries. His pseudo-parental figures step up and Tony and Peter have a heart-to-heart of sorts.
